Error":"Losing the sign of the product: one zero is negative and one positive, so ${{f1}}\\cdot {{f2|paren}}$ is negative.","answerSummary":"$a={{a0}}$"},"assessmentItemFormat":"studentProducedResponse","responseFields":[{"id":"answer","label":"Answer","inputProfile":"number","expected":"{{a0}}"}]}]}
